    "title": "Yaxel Lendeborg – NBA Draft Room",
    "text": "NBA DRAFT SCOUTING REPORTPOSITION: PFFROM: Michigan(UAB)HT: 6-9WT: 235BORN: NAYEAR: Sr.WING: 7-4REACH: NADraft NotesA well-built, fundamentally sound and complete player who has a great feel for the game. Is an older prospect but one who picked up the game late and is just coming into his own as a player.Rebounds the ball at a high level, is a solid defender, both in the paint, defending the rim and playing great team defense. Has good hands and gets a lot of steals. His huge wingspan is a major factor on the glass and defending in the paint.Shows some floor spacing ability and a much improved 3pt shot. Is very efficient with his touches, makes good decisions with the ball and doesn’t try to do too much.His feel for the game is unique for a PF/C and he’s got some offensive hub capabilities.Is a very good athlete with all the speed, agility and above the rim ability you could hope for.Comparisonshigher feel Obi ToppinDraft Projectionlate lottery to mid first round pick in the 2026 NBA DraftLatest Big BoardVideos 2026 PF RankingsCameron Boozer – 6-9 – DukeCaleb Wilson – 6-10 – North CarolinaKoa Peat – 6-8 – ArizonaHannes Steinbach – 6-11 – Washington (Germany)Yaxel Lendeborg – 6-9 – MichiganThomas Haugh – 6-9 – FloridaJT Toppin – 6-9 – Texas TechJoshua Jefferson – 6-9 – Iowa StateJohann Grunloh – 6-10 – Virginia (Germany)Trey Kaufman-Renn – 6-9 – PurdueTyler Bilodeau – 6-9 – UCLAMalik Reneau – 6-7 – MiamiBryson Tiller – 6-10 – KansasTrevon Brazile – 6-9 – ArkansasGraham Ike – 6-9 – GonzagaJoseph Tugler – 6-7 – HoustonMichael Ruzic – 6-9 – CroatiaDonnie Freeman – 6-9 – SyracuseTaylor Bowen – 6-9 – AlabamaNoa Kouakou – 6-10 – FranceHugo Facorat – 6-10 – FranceMichael Nwoko – 6-9 – LSUJaxon Kohler – 6-9 – Michigan StateBrandon Garrison – 6-9 – KentuckyBaye Ndongo – 6-9 – Georgia Tech (Senegal)Malik Dia – 6-9 – Ole MissJackson McAndrew – 6-9 – CreightonAlexandros Samodurav – 6-11 – GreeceTobe Awaka – 6-8 – ArizonaMohamed Diakite – 6-10 – FranceBassala Bagayok